# Production build defaults, committed on purpose.
#
# Vite loads this file from `apps/web` for every `vite build`, so the deployed
# HTML is self-describing without a dashboard setting: canonical URLs, Open
# Graph cards, `sitemap.xml` and `robots.txt` point at the real origin, and the
# bundle is the frontend-only shape (no sign-in, no workflow runner, no `/api`
# calls). See `apps/web/src/lib/deployment.ts`.
#
# Both values are public (they end up in the HTML), so there is nothing secret
# here. A shell variable or a CI environment variable with the same name still
# wins over this file, which is how a self-hoster points at their own domain.
VITE_SITE_ORIGIN=https://pdfshush.space
VITE_SERVER_API=off
